      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "diatessaron_verse": "4",
      "ref": "Matthew 21:20b",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "kering?\"",
      "ref_id": "Matius 21:20b",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "diatessaron_verse": "4",
      "ref": "Mark 11:21",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Maka teringatlah Petrus akan apa yang telah terjadi, lalu ia berkata kepada Yesus: \"Rabi, lihatlah,",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:21",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "diatessaron_verse": "5",
      "ref": "Mark 11:21",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "pohon ara yang Kaukutuk itu sudah kering.",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:21",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "diatessaron_verse": "5",
      "ref": "Mark 11:22",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Yesus menjawab",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:22",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "diatessaron_verse": "6",
      "ref": "Mark 11:22",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "mereka: \"Percayalah kepada Allah!",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:22",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "diatessaron_verse": "6",
      "ref": "Mark 11:23",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Aku berkata kepadamu: Sesungguhnya barangsiapa berkata kepada gunung ini: Beranjaklah dan tercampaklah ke dalam laut! asal tidak bimbang hatinya, tetapi percaya, bahwa apa yang",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:23",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "diatessaron_verse": "7",
      "ref": "Mark 11:23",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "dikatakannya itu akan terjadi, maka hal itu akan terjadi baginya.",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:23",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "diatessaron_verse": "7",
      "ref": "Matthew 21:21b",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "tetapi juga jikalau kamu berkata kepada gunung ini: Beranjaklah dan",
      "ref_id": "Matius 21:21b",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "diatessaron_verse": "8",
      "ref": "Matthew 21:21b",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "tercampaklah ke dalam laut! hal itu akan terjadi.",
      "ref_id": "Matius 21:21b",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "diatessaron_verse": "8",
      "ref": "Matthew 21:22",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Dan apa saja yang kamu minta dalam doa dengan penuh kepercayaan,",
      "ref_id": "Matius 21:22",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "diatessaron_verse": "9, 10",
      "ref": "Matthew 21:22",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "kamu akan menerimanya.\"",
      "ref_id": "Matius 21:22",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "diatessaron_verse": "9, 10",
      "ref": "Luke 17:5",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Lalu kata rasul-rasul itu kepada Tuhan: \"Tambahkanlah iman kami!\"",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 17:5",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "diatessaron_verse": "9, 10",
      "ref": "Luke 17:6",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Jawab Tuhan: \"Kalau sekiranya kamu mempunyai iman sebesar biji sesawi saja, kamu dapat berkata kepada pohon ara ini: Terbantunlah engkau dan tertanamlah di dalam laut, dan ia akan taat kepadamu.\"",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 17:6",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 30
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "diatessaron_verse": "11",
      "ref": "Luke 17:7",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "\"Siapa di antara kamu yang mempunyai seorang hamba yang membajak atau",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 17:7",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "diatessaron_verse": "12",
      "ref": "Luke 17:7",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "menggembalakan ternak baginya, akan berkata kepada hamba itu, setelah ia pulang dari ladang: Mari segera makan!",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 17:7",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "diatessaron_verse": "12",
      "ref": "Luke 17:8",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Bukankah sebaliknya ia akan berkata kepada hamba itu: Sediakanlah makananku. Ikatlah pinggangmu dan layanilah aku sampai selesai aku makan dan minum. Dan sesudah itu engkau boleh makan dan minum.",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 17:8",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 29
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "diatessaron_verse": "13",
      "ref": "Luke 17:9",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Adakah ia berterima kasih kepada hamba itu, karena hamba itu telah melakukan apa yang ditugaskan",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 17:9",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "diatessaron_verse": "14",
      "ref": "Luke 17:9",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "kepadanya?.",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 17:9",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "diatessaron_verse": "14",
      "ref": "Luke 17:10",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Demikian jugalah kamu. Apabila kamu telah melakukan segala sesuatu yang ditugaskan kepadamu, hendaklah kamu berkata: Kami adalah hamba-hamba yang tidak berguna; kami hanya melakukan apa yang kami harus lakukan.\"",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 17:10",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 29
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "diatessaron_verse": "15",
      "ref": "Mark 11:24",
      "arabic_page": 125,
      "text": "Karena itu Aku berkata kepadamu: apa saja yang kamu minta dan doakan, percayalah bahwa kamu telah",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:24",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "diatessaron_verse": "16",
      "ref": "Mark 11:24",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "menerimanya, maka hal itu akan diberikan kepadamu.",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:24",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "diatessaron_verse": "16",
      "ref": "Mark 11:25",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Dan jika kamu berdiri untuk berdoa, ampunilah dahulu sekiranya ada barang sesuatu dalam hatimu terhadap seseorang, supaya juga Bapamu yang di sorga",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:25",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "diatessaron_verse": "17",
      "ref": "Mark 11:25",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "mengampuni kesalahan-kesalahanmu.\"",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:25",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "diatessaron_verse": "17",
      "ref": "Mark 11:26",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "(Tetapi jika kamu tidak mengampuni, maka Bapamu yang di sorga juga tidak akan mengampuni kesalahan-kesalahanmu.)",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:26",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "diatessaron_verse": "18",
      "ref": "Luke 18:1",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Yesus mengatakan suatu perumpamaan kepada mereka untuk menegaskan, bahwa mereka harus selalu berdoa dengan",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:1",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "diatessaron_verse": "19",
      "ref": "Luke 18:1",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "tidak jemu-jemu.",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:1",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "diatessaron_verse": "19",
      "ref": "Luke 18:2",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Kata-Nya: \"Dalam sebuah kota ada seorang hakim yang tidak takut akan Allah dan tidak menghormati",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:2",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "diatessaron_verse": "20",
      "ref": "Luke 18:2",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "seorangpun.",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:2",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "diatessaron_verse": "20",
      "ref": "Luke 18:3",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Dan di kota itu ada seorang janda yang selalu datang kepada hakim itu dan berkata:",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:3",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "diatessaron_verse": "21",
      "ref": "Luke 18:3",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Belalah hakku terhadap lawanku.",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:3",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "diatessaron_verse": "21",
      "ref": "Luke 18:4",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Beberapa waktu lamanya hakim itu menolak. Tetapi kemudian ia berkata dalam hatinya: Walaupun aku tidak takut akan Allah dan tidak menghormati seorangpun,",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:4",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "diatessaron_verse": "22",
      "ref": "Luke 18:5",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "namun karena janda ini menyusahkan aku, baiklah aku membenarkan dia, supaya jangan terus saja ia datang dan akhirnya",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:5",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "diatessaron_verse": "23, 24",
      "ref": "Luke 18:5",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "menyerang aku.\"",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:5",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "diatessaron_verse": "23, 24",
      "ref": "Luke 18:6",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Kata Tuhan: \"Camkanlah apa yang dikatakan hakim yang lalim itu.",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:6",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "diatessaron_verse": "23, 24",
      "ref": "Luke 18:7",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Tidakkah Allah akan membenarkan orang-orang pilihan-Nya yang siang",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:7",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "diatessaron_verse": "25",
      "ref": "Luke 18:7",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "malam berseru kepada-Nya? Dan adakah Ia mengulur-ulur waktu sebelum menolong mereka?",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:7",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "diatessaron_verse": "25",
      "ref": "Luke 18:8",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Aku berkata kepadamu: Ia akan segera membenarkan mereka. Akan tetapi, jika Anak Manusia itu datang, adakah Ia mendapati iman di bumi?\"",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 18:8",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "diatessaron_verse": "26, 27",
      "ref": "Mark 11:15a",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Lalu tibalah Yesus dan murid-murid-Nya di Yerusalem.",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:15a",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "diatessaron_verse": "26, 27",
      "ref": "Luke 20:1",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Pada suatu hari ketika Yesus mengajar orang banyak di Bait Allah dan memberitakan",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 20:1",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "diatessaron_verse": "28",
      "ref": "Luke 20:1",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Injil, datanglah imam-imam kepala dan ahli-ahli Taurat serta tua-tua ke situ,",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 20:1",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "diatessaron_verse": "28",
      "ref": "Luke 20:2a",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "dan mereka berkata kepada Yesus: \"Katakanlah kepada kami",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 20:2a",
      "book_code": "luk",
      "book_en": "Luke",
      "book_id": "Lukas",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "diatessaron_verse": "28",
      "ref": "Mark 11:28b",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "\"Dengan kuasa manakah Engkau melakukan hal-hal itu? Dan siapakah yang memberikan",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:28b",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "diatessaron_verse": "29",
      "ref": "Mark 11:28b",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "kuasa itu kepada-Mu, sehingga Engkau melakukan hal-hal itu?\"",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:28b",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "diatessaron_verse": "29",
      "ref": "Mark 11:29",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Jawab Yesus kepada mereka: \"Aku akan mengajukan satu pertanyaan kepadamu. Berikanlah",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:29",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "diatessaron_verse": "30",
      "ref": "Mark 11:29",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Aku jawabnya, maka Aku akan mengatakan kepadamu dengan kuasa manakah Aku melakukan hal-hal itu.",
      "ref_id": "Markus 11:29",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "diatessaron_verse": "30",
      "ref": "Matthew 21:25a",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "Dari",
      "ref_id": "Matius 21:25a",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "diatessaron_verse": "31",
      "ref": "Matthew 21:25a",
      "arabic_page": 126,
      "text": "manakah baptisan Yohanes? Dari sorga atau dari manusia?\"",
